NEUROGENESIS-Lab 1.0.0
Copyright 2026 Yucong Duan and contributors.

Prepared for Yucong Duan as an English open-source companion to
A Brief History of the Nervous System: From Life Sensing to Consciousness
and Civilization. Original software and documentation in this delivery were
prepared with generative-AI assistance and remain open to author and peer review.

The companion is inspired by the book's research requirements and by engineering
patterns inspected in NEPHROGENESIS-Lab. The new Python modules are original
implementations; no wholesale upstream source tree is redistributed. The example
nephrogenesis_transport_result.json was generated from the supplied Apache-2.0
NEPHROGENESIS-Lab 1.0.0 engine and retains its original result semantics.

The book's full text, third-party articles, trademarks, and font files are NOT
included or relicensed. Section identifiers and source hashes are provenance
references. ResearchGate listing metadata is not a substitute for reviewed text.
Apache-2.0 applies to this original software and accompanying original documents.
Synthetic passive_step.csv is additionally offered under CC0-1.0.
No DOI, institutional endorsement, medical clearance, or public GitHub publication
is asserted by this local delivery.
